OL,3,AFewer mothers to appear in court days
OL,4,Aafter giving birth under new guidance
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of mothers going to court
OL,7,Ffor child care proceedings within hours
OL,8,For days of giving birth will be reduced
OL,9,Fafter new guidance was issued to
OL,10,Fjudges.
OL,12,FThe changes follow concerns about the
OL,13,Fincreasing number of urgent
OL,14,Fapplications brought to family courts
OL,15,Ffor newborn babies where there is a
OL,16,Fsafeguarding concern.
OL,18,FA recent BBC investigation highlighted
OL,19,Fthe issue after hearing of the
OL,20,Ftraumatic experience for mothers having
OL,21,Fto attend court while recovering from
OL,22,Flabour.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
