OL,3,AFewer mothers to appear in court days
OL,4,Aafter giving birth under new guidance
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the new guidance issued by the
OL,7,FJudiciary, same-day hearings should
OL,8,Fonly be granted if a child's immediate
OL,9,Fsafety is at risk to ensure
OL,10,Fintervention is "focused on cases that
OL,11,Fgenuinely require it".
